# NOTE: src/personalBookmarks.tsx is intentionally NOT ignored — it's
# tracked as an empty public template so the repo always builds. A local
# build with real personal data edits that file in place and marks it
# `git update-index --skip-worktree src/personalBookmarks.tsx` so those
# edits are excluded from git's view instead of relying on .gitignore
# (which only applies to untracked files).
